	(text "JP1 pins 23/25 belong to the existing GPIO7/8 touch bus and are unused here.\nGPIO35 (BOOT), GPIO52 and ESP32-C6 pins are deliberately unconnected.\nGPIO28/29 I2C is implemented; physical harness and rise time remain to be tested."
